{
    "name": "E2E Shopify - Updated Draft Order Trigger",
    "description": "Updated Draft Order fires for a draft order updated through the GraphQL Admin API.",
    "notes": {
        "a8321aac-5312-43b2-9f61-cd646c9e4b83": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 32,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 224,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Self-provoking trigger flow\n\nThe bottom lane creates a draft order (`draftOrderCreate`) one minute after the start and updates its note (`draftOrderUpdate`) a minute later. Keep both **Wait** steps: the first lets the webhook subscription become active, the second separates the update from the creation.\n\nThe trigger lane deletes the emitted draft order after `AfterAll`. The app needs `read_draft_orders` and `write_draft_orders`."
        }
    },
